{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d789","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b131-d4f6-7b82-a7a6-5363cf3ac7fb"},"sequence":2591,"recorded_at":1780531400005177,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"2237b1e3-856b-4a22-9f46-61adba667efd","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"2237b1e3-856b-4a22-9f46-61adba667efd","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"2237b1e3-856b-4a22-9f46-61adba667efd"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b13f-17a7-7001-b3e5-88e570980761"},"task_id":"01a0b13f-17a7-7001-b3e5-88e570980761","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b13f-17a7-7001-b3e5-88e570980761","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 116-129\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-// Bind durably binds (session_id, bootstrap_operation_id) to the one\n-// recorded wrapper/child before any launch side effect. The first\n-// call for a session installs the candidate receipt; an identical\n-// retry returns the stored receipt with reattached true; a changed\n-// operation refuses idempotency_mismatch while the bootstrap window\n-// is open. After the window closes (the winner carries a\n-// checkpoint) a new operation supersedes through Supersede, never\n-// through this no-replace entry. The candidate's session and\n-// operation must equal the call arguments; its instance ID and\n-// binding digest are validated, and the store stamps created_at at\n-// install. The stored receipt is authoritative on retry: a retry\n-// carrying different child facts still reattaches to the one\n-// recorded child, never to a second child. Stale staging files\n-// from a pre-commit crash are swept before the install.\n+// Bind durably binds (session_id, bootstrap_operation_id) to the one\n+// recorded wrapper/child before any launch side effect. The first\n+// call for a session anchors the candidate receipt and records its\n+// pair receipt from the same bytes; an identical retry returns the\n+// stored pair receipt with reattached true; a changed operation\n+// refuses idempotency_mismatch while the bootstrap window is open.\n+// After the window closes a new operation records its own pair\n+// receipt through Supersede, never through this no-replace entry.\n+// The candidate's session and operation must equal the call\n+// arguments; its instance ID and binding digest are validated, and\n+// the store stamps created_at at install. The stored receipt is\n+// authoritative on retry: a retry carrying different child facts\n+// still reattaches to the one recorded child, never to a second\n+// child. Stale staging files from a pre-commit crash are swept\n+// before the install.\n","final_result":true}}}
