{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ec5f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b131-d4f6-7b82-a7a6-5363cf3ac7fb"},"sequence":5258,"recorded_at":1780531400010511,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"2237b1e3-856b-4a22-9f46-61adba667efd","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"2237b1e3-856b-4a22-9f46-61adba667efd","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"2237b1e3-856b-4a22-9f46-61adba667efd"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Ready for review — handed off to review.\n\n**Outcome:** rev3 rework of TASK-260830-1geqhj is complete on trunk `2fc6d50` (SPEC.v0.7.0). Status `to-review`, checklist 19/19, candidate left UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree. All rev2 verdict branches closed: the P1-1 keying class at all three gates, P2-1, P2-2, and P3-1–P3-8.\n\n**What changed (production):**\n- Window, checkpoint admission, and journal source binding now read the chain fold's newest checkpoint (`LoadNewestCheckpoint` → `sessstate.Reduce`), never the lease record's null-for-epoch-1 checkpoint; a successor lease's handoff base must agree (`leaseCheckpointAgrees`) — [decide.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-ptxkqe/worktree/internal/axpane/decide.go)\n- Per-pair receipts (`Store.Lookup`, no-replace per pair) with the first binding as in-window anchor; `Run` fails when a checkpoint-carrying winner has no checkpoint store — [binding.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-ptxkqe/worktree/internal/axpane/binding.go), [run.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-ptxkqe/worktree/internal/axpane/run.go)\n- §4.C credential conditional for every smoke-requiring caller, any-match realm cross-bind, typed `capability_unavailable` for dead realm evidence\n\n**Evidence:** AC 43 of 43 rows driven (re-derived by counting; the four unfaithful rev2 rows re-pinned); 21 new committed